      {
        "id": "example-explanation",
        "kind": "comment",
        "comment_auto_size": false,
        "text": "Sample a surface with parameters\nWith a=2,b=3, a*x1+b*x2 is sampled at x1=[0,1],x2=[0,2]. Named parameter Records and the rank-two output persist in the actual document.\nEntrées -> opération -> indicateurs. Résultat attendu : output-x1_values (array<f64>) = [0,1]\noutput-x2_values (array<f64>) = [0,2]\noutput-y_values (array<f64,rank=2>) = {\"shape\":[2,2],\"elements\":[0,2,6,8]}\noutput-error (i32) = 0\n",
        "vertical_arrangement": "none",
        "font": {
          "family": "",
          "style": "plain",
          "use_default_size": false,
          "geometry_initialized": false,
          "point_size": 11
        },
        "hidden": false,
        "locked": false,
        "group": "",
        "layout": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": -20,
          "width": 780,
          "height": 140
        }
      }
